                        "notes": "Feature release: the five items from the September upstream audit judged worth porting. Every new prop defaults to off; the only 4.1.1 renders that change are the two noted below.\n\n### ⚠️ Behaviour changes\n- **The table toolbar has a third action**, so turning copy and download off no longer removes the bar; add `fullscreen: false` or use `{ table: false }`.\n- **The exported `parseIncompleteMarkdown` strips a half-typed HTML tag by default** (`live` defaults to `true`); pass `{ live: false }` for finished text. `Streamdown` passes it for you: only the last block is live, and only its last line",
